<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Prüfstand compare</title>
{% include "_style.html.j2" %}
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <h1>Paired comparison</h1>
  <p class="lead">A = <code>{{ c.run_a }}</code> (defenses: {{ c.defenses_a | join(", ") or "none" }}),
  B = <code>{{ c.run_b }}</code> (defenses: {{ c.defenses_b | join(", ") or "none" }}).
  Episodes are paired by (model, task, condition, variant, attempt). The outcome is attack success
  (attacker goal met or canary leaked) for poison and inject, and state pass for every other condition.
  Rates are means over tasks with 95% task-bootstrap intervals, computed on the paired episodes only.
  Exploratory dev-suite results.</p>

  <section class="panel">
  <table>
    <tr><th>Model</th><th>Condition</th><th>Variant</th><th>Outcome</th><th>Pairs</th>
        <th>A</th><th>B</th><th>Change (pts)</th><th>Only A</th><th>Only B</th>
        <th>Odds ratio</th><th>McNemar p</th></tr>
    {% for r in rows %}
    <tr{% if r.variant == "all" %} class="dim"{% endif %}>
      <td>{{ r.model }}</td><td>{{ r.condition }}</td>
      <td>{{ "all payloads" if r.variant == "all" else r.variant }}</td><td>{{ r.outcome }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.n_pairs }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.rate_a }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.rate_b }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.change }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.only_a }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.only_b }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ r.odds_ratio }}</td><td class="num">{{ r.p_value }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </table>
  </section>
  <p class="muted">Only A: outcome true in A and false in B (for an attack: the attacker won without the
  change and lost with it). Only B: the reverse. Odds ratio = only B / only A, with 0.5 added to both
  when either is zero. McNemar's test is exact (binomial) below {{ exact_below }} discordant pairs,
  otherwise chi-square with continuity correction ({{ "*" }}). Unpaired rows: A {{ c.unpaired_a }},
  B {{ c.unpaired_b }}. Pairs dropped for transport failure: {{ c.dropped_transport }}.
  Written {{ written }}.</p>
</main>
</body>
</html>
